p Check this out :
div.row
  div.col-2: :markdown-it
    ```mermaid
    flowchart LR
    Hello --> World
    ```
  div.col-1: i.fa-solid.fa-arrow-right.fa-2xl
  div.col.mb-3: :mermaid
    flowchart LR
    Hello --> World
:markdown-it
  If you don't know what I'm talking about, [Mermaid](https://mermaid.js.org/) is a JavaScript library that can generate flowcharts, pie charts, diagrams and other stuff.

  I created a custom Pug filter that automatically converts Mermaid code to SVG.

  If you want to learn how it works, check out [the site's repo](https://github.com/DarkblooM-IO/darkbloom-io.github.io).
